From ded01e59daba4072f14d08aa54b54fdb0f1d2b90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cui Yuting <yutingcui@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:55:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] EyePiece print-rendering patches for topo map generation

- Export raster georeference: true corner lat/lon via
  getLocationFromScreenPoint -> <image>.georef.json
- Hillshade: expose -slopeColors (shade*slope blend fix); OsmAnd standard
  hillshade_main/hillshade_color palettes work with gdaldem; drop the
  hardcoded -z 2 vertical exaggeration
- Coordinate grid: -primaryGrid=utm|wgs84 + granularity gate fix
- Elevation/3D relief off unless -elevation (displacement warped rasters)
- Frame loop: hold renderer idle ~3s in single-raster mode (cold-start
  captures used to grab stub tiles); tolerate shutdown segfault
---

